            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "hi,\n\ni tried to deploy the jackrabbit war (checkout from 20.6.07 and updated on 26.6.07) which failed.\n\nas soon as i disabled RMI in bootstrap.properties (rmi.enabled=false) i got redirected to the setup configuration page again. after that modification i could happily use the webapp again.\n\ncould you please check if this problem is related to your changes regarding RMI default?\n\nthanks\nangela",
